@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome
actor User as user
actor Anonymous as anon
actor Moderator as mod
:anon: --> (UC1: Login)
:anon: --> (UC2: Register)

:user: --> (UC3: Create Thread)
:user: --> (UC4: Create Group)

:user: --> (UC5: Send Message)
:anon: --> (UC5: Send Message)
(UC6: Send Unregistered Message) --> (UC5: Send Message): Extends
(UC7: Send Registered Message) --> (UC5: Send Message): Extends

:user: --> (UC7: Send Registered Message) 
:anon: --> (UC6: Send Unregistered Message)

:anon: --> (UC8: View Thread Messages)
:user: --> (UC8: View Thread Messages)

:user: --> (UC15: View Group Messages)

:user: --> (UC9: Edit Own Messages)
:user: --> (UC10: Edit Own Threads)
:user: --> (UC11: Edit Own Groups)

:user: --> (UC12: View Threads)
:anon: --> (UC12: View Threads)

:mod: --> (UC13: Edit Messages)
:mod: --> (UC14: Edit Threads)

(UC9: Edit Own Messages) --> (UC13: Edit Messages): Extends
(UC10: Edit Own Threads) --> (UC14: Edit Threads): Extends

:mod: --> (UC15: Ban Users)

(UC1: Login) --> (UC2: Register): use
(UC6: Send Unregistered Message) --> (UC1: Login): use
(UC12: View Threads) --> (UC3: Create Thread): use
(UC8: View Thread Messages) --> (UC5: Send Message): use
(UC15: View Group Messages) --> (UC7: Send Registered Message): use
(UC9: Edit Own Messages) --> (UC5: Send Message): use
(UC10: Edit Own Threads) --> (UC3: Create Thread): use
(UC11: Edit Own Groups) --> (UC4: Create Group): use
(UC13: Edit Messages) --> (UC5: Send Message): use
(UC14: Edit Threads) --> (UC3: Create Thread): use
@enduml